        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Handwritten Document</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 20px;\n        background-color: #e0e0e0;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n        font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n    }\n\n    .document-wrapper {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 900px;\n        height: 650px;\n        background-color: #f8f9fa;\n        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    /* Grid background simulating the paper */\n    .grid-bg {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        right: 0;\n        bottom: 0;\n        background-image: \n            linear-gradient(to right, #a0c8e0 1px, transparent 1px),\n            linear-gradient(to bottom, #a0c8e0 1px, transparent 1px);\n        background-size: 45px 45px;\n        background-position: 0 0;\n        z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    /* Top left title styling */\n    .page-number {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 20px;\n        left: 30px;\n        font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 38px;\n        font-weight: 900;\n        color: #ffe600;\n        -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #000;\n        text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;\n        z-index: 10;\n        transform: skewX(-10deg);\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n\n    /* Main content area for vertical text */\n    .content {\n        position: relative;\n        z-index: 2;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 100%;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        /* Padding to align text perfectly within the grid cells */\n        padding-top: 9px; \n        padding-right: 9px; \n        writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    }\n\n    /* Individual columns of text */\n    .column {\n        margin: 0;\n        width: 45px; /* Matches grid width */\n        font-size: 26px;\n        line-height: 45px; /* Centers text horizontally in grid */\n        letter-spacing: 19px; /* (45px grid height - 26px font size) to align vertically */\n        color: #1a1a1a;\n    }\n\n    /* Spacer for empty columns */\n    .empty-col {\n        margin: 0;\n        width: 45px;\n    }\n\n    /* Specific vertical indentations for the signature area */\n    .indent-1 { padding-top: 270px; } /* 此致 */\n    .indent-2 { padding-top: 360px; } /* 莫言 */\n    .indent-3 { padding-top: 450px; } /* 日期 */\n\n    /* Seal placeholder styling */\n    .placeholder {\n        display: inline-flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        width: 35px;\n        height: 35px;\n        border: 2px solid #d32f2f;\n        color: #d32f2f;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        writing-mode: horizontal-tb; /* Forces text inside to be horizontal */\n        letter-spacing: normal;\n        margin-top: 15px;\n        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        text-align: center;\n        border-radius: 2px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"document-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"grid-bg\"></div>\n    <div class=\"page-number\">第三页</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content\">\n        <p class=\"column\">因为牛的构造是这样，就比较</p>\n        <p class=\"column\">清楚了。一般情况下，牛羊是不会</p>\n        <p class=\"column\">用舌头卷水的（用舌头卷水的是</p>\n        <p class=\"column\">狗与猫），它们会把嘴贴到水面</p>\n        <p class=\"column\">上往里吸水。</p>\n        \n        <p class=\"empty-col\"></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"column\">总之，必须注意观察细</p>\n        <p class=\"column\">节，也要注意训练思考线的</p>\n        <p class=\"column\">基础，极度细致的观察。</p>\n        \n        <p class=\"empty-col\"></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"column\">拉杂写来，都是老生常谈，</p>\n        <p class=\"column\">请谅吧。</p>\n        \n        <p class=\"empty-col\"></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"column indent-1\">此致　　笔健！</p>\n        \n        <p class=\"empty-col\"></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"column indent-2\">莫言<span class=\"placeholder\">[Seal:<br>red]</span></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"empty-col\"></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"column indent-3\">癸卯五月七日晚</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
